#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:183
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of FFmpeg"
msgstr "Instalação do FFmpeg"

#.  qtwebengine
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:186
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, apply a patch that adds an API necessary for some packages to build:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, aplique um remendo que adicione uma API necessária para alguns "
"pacotes construírem:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:191
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-"
"version;-chromium_method-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-"
"version;-chromium_method-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:194
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>FFmpeg</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>FFmpeg</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:198
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"            --enable-gpl         \\\n"
"            --enable-version3    \\\n"
"            --enable-nonfree     \\\n"
"            --disable-static     \\\n"
"            --enable-shared      \\\n"
"            --disable-debug      \\\n"
"            --enable-libaom      \\\n"
"            --enable-libass      \\\n"
"            --enable-libfdk-aac  \\\n"
"            --enable-libfreetype \\\n"
"            --enable-libmp3lame  \\\n"
"            --enable-libopus     \\\n"
"            --enable-libvorbis   \\\n"
"            --enable-libvpx      \\\n"
"            --enable-libx264     \\\n"
"            --enable-libx265     \\\n"
"            --enable-openssl     \\\n"
"            --enable-libdav1d    \\\n"
"            --enable-libsvtav1   \\\n"
"            --ignore-tests=enhanced-flv-av1,enhanced-flv-multitrack \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"make &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"gcc tools/qt-faststart.c -o tools/qt-faststart</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"            --enable-gpl         \\\n"
"            --enable-version3    \\\n"
"            --enable-nonfree     \\\n"
"            --disable-static     \\\n"
"            --enable-shared      \\\n"
"            --disable-debug      \\\n"
"            --enable-libaom      \\\n"
"            --enable-libass      \\\n"
"            --enable-libfdk-aac  \\\n"
"            --enable-libfreetype \\\n"
"            --enable-libmp3lame  \\\n"
"            --enable-libopus     \\\n"
"            --enable-libvorbis   \\\n"
"            --enable-libvpx      \\\n"
"            --enable-libx264     \\\n"
"            --enable-libx265     \\\n"
"            --enable-openssl     \\\n"
"            --enable-libdav1d    \\\n"
"            --enable-libsvtav1   \\\n"
"            --ignore-tests=enhanced-flv-av1,enhanced-flv-multitrack \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"make &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"gcc tools/qt-faststart.c -o tools/qt-faststart</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:226
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"HTML documentation was built in the previous step. If you have <xref "
"linkend=\"texlive\"/> installed and wish to build PDF and Postscript "
"versions of the documentation, issue the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"A documentação HTML foi construída na etapa anterior. Se você tiver o <xref "
"linkend=\"texlive\"/> instalado e desejar construir versões PDF e Postscript"
" da documentação, emita os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:231
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>pushd doc &amp;&amp;\n"
"for DOCNAME in `basename -s .html *.html`\n"
"do\n"
"    texi2pdf -b $DOCNAME.texi &amp;&amp;\n"
"    texi2dvi -b $DOCNAME.texi &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"    dvips    -o $DOCNAME.ps   \\\n"
"                $DOCNAME.dvi\n"
"done &amp;&amp;\n"
"popd &amp;&amp;\n"
"unset DOCNAME</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>pushd doc &amp;&amp;\n"
"for DOCNAME in `basename -s .html *.html`\n"
"do\n"
"    texi2pdf -b $DOCNAME.texi &amp;&amp;\n"
"    texi2dvi -b $DOCNAME.texi &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"    dvips    -o $DOCNAME.ps   \\\n"
"                $DOCNAME.dvi\n"
"done &amp;&amp;\n"
"popd &amp;&amp;\n"
"unset DOCNAME</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:244
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> installed and you wish to build (if "
"--disable-doc was used) or rebuild the html documentation, issue:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver o <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> instalado e desejar construir "
"(se --disable-doc foi usado) ou reconstruir a documentação HTML, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:249
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>doxygen doc/Doxyfile</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>doxygen doc/Doxyfile</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:252
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The fate-suite tests include comparisons with installed files, and should "
"not be run before the package is installed. Therefore, if you desire to run "
"them, instructions are given further below."
msgstr ""
"Os testes da suíte FATE incluem comparações com arquivos instalados e não "
"deveriam ser executados antes que o pacote esteja instalado. Portanto, se "
"você desejar executá-los, as instruções são fornecidas mais abaixo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:258
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:261
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m755    tools/qt-faststart /usr/bin &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m755 -d           /usr/share/doc/ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644    doc/*.txt /usr/share/doc/ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m755    tools/qt-faststart /usr/bin &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m755 -d           /usr/share/doc/ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644    doc/*.txt /usr/share/doc/ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:268
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If the PDF and Postscript documentation was built, issue the following "
"commands, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, to "
"install them:"
msgstr ""
"Se a documentação PDF e Postscript foi construída, emita os seguintes "
"comandos, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>, para instalá-las:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:274
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -m644 doc/*.pdf /usr/share/doc/ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/*.ps  /usr/share/doc/ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -m644 doc/*.pdf /usr/share/doc/ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/*.ps  /usr/share/doc/ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:278
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you used <command>doxygen</command> to manually create the API "
"documentation, install it by issuing the following commands as the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você usou o <command>doxygen</command> para criar manualmente a "
"documentação da API, instale-a emitindo os seguintes comandos como o(a) "
"usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:284
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -m755 -d /usr/share/doc/ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-version;/api                     &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -vr doc/doxy/html/* /usr/share/doc/ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-version;/api                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"find /usr/share/doc/ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-version;/api -type f -exec chmod -c 0644 \\{} \\; &amp;&amp;\n"
"find /usr/share/doc/ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-version;/api -type d -exec chmod -c 0755 \\{} \\;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -m755 -d /usr/share/doc/ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-version;/api                     &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -vr doc/doxy/html/* /usr/share/doc/ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-version;/api                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"find /usr/share/doc/ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-version;/api -type f -exec chmod -c 0644 \\{} \\; &amp;&amp;\n"
"find /usr/share/doc/ffmpeg-&ffmpeg-version;/api -type d -exec chmod -c 0755 \\{} \\;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:290
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To properly test the installation you must have <xref linkend=\"rsync\"/> "
"installed and follow the instructions for the <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.ffmpeg.org/fate.html\"> FFmpeg Automated Testing "
"Environment</ulink> (FATE). First, about 1 GB of sample files used to run "
"FATE are downloaded with the command:"
msgstr ""
"Para testar a instalação corretamente, você precisa ter o <xref "
"linkend=\"rsync\"/> instalado e seguir as instruções para o <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.ffmpeg.org/fate.html\">FFmpeg Automated Testing "
"Environment</ulink> (FATE). Primeiro, cerca de 1 GB de arquivos de amostra "
"usados para executar o FATE são baixados com o comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:297
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make fate-rsync SAMPLES=fate-suite/</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make fate-rsync SAMPLES=fate-suite/</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:300
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <filename class=\"directory\">fate-suite</filename> directory is created"
" and the files are downloaded there. That command actually runs an rsync "
"command to obtain the sample files.  You may want to compress and keep this "
"directory for testing again, for testing in another system, or for when a "
"new version of ffmpeg is released. Then, unpack the sample files in the "
"source directory, and run the <command>make fate-rsync ...</command> command"
" above to sync with the upstream repository. The download size and time are "
"drastically reduced by doing this.  Estimated values in \"Package "
"Information\" do not include the download SBU. Some samples may have been "
"removed in newer versions, so in order to be sure local and server fate "
"samples are identical when you use previously saved samples, run the "
"following command:"
msgstr ""
"O diretório <filename class=\"directory\">fate-suite</filename> é criado e "
"os arquivos são baixados lá. Esse comando, atualmente, executa um comando "
"rsync para obter os arquivos de amostra. Você possivelmente queira comprimir"
" e manter esse diretório para testagem novamente, para testagem em outro "
"sistema ou para quando uma nova versão do FFmpeg for lançada. Em seguida, "
"desempacote os arquivos de amostra no diretório do fonte e execute o comando"
" <command>make fate-rsync ...</command> acima para sincronizar com o "
"repositório do(a) desenvolvedor(a). O tamanho e o tempo da transferência são"
" drasticamente reduzidos com isso. Os valores estimados em \"Informações do "
"Pacote\" não incluem o UPC de transferência. Algumas amostras possivelmente "
"tenham sido removidas em versões mais recentes, de forma que, para a "
"finalidade de ter certeza de que as amostras FATE locais e do servidor sejam"
" idênticas, ao usar amostras salvas anteriormente, execute o seguinte "
"comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:314
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>rsync -vrltLW  --delete --timeout=60 --contimeout=60 \\\n"
"      rsync://fate-suite.ffmpeg.org/fate-suite/ fate-suite/</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>rsync -vrltLW  --delete --timeout=60 --contimeout=60 \\\n"
"      rsync://fate-suite.ffmpeg.org/fate-suite/ fate-suite/</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:318
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Next, execute FATE with the following commands (there are more than 5200 "
"tests in the suite):"
msgstr ""
"Em seguida, execute FATE com os seguintes comandos (existem mais que cinco "
"mil e duzentos (5.200) testes na suíte):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:322
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make fate THREADS=<replaceable>N</replaceable> SAMPLES=fate-suite/ | tee ../fate.log &amp;&amp;\n"
"grep ^TEST ../fate.log | wc -l</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make fate THREADS=<replaceable>N</replaceable> SAMPLES=fate-suite/ | tee ../fate.log &amp;&amp;\n"
"grep ^TEST ../fate.log | wc -l</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:326
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"where <replaceable>N</replaceable> is an integer, "
"<replaceable>N</replaceable> &le; number of cores in the system."
msgstr ""
"onde <replaceable>N</replaceable> é um inteiro, <replaceable>N</replaceable>"
" &le; número de elementos de processamento no sistema."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:331
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"A successful run should return no errors or warnings, just a list of tests."
msgstr ""
"Uma execução bem-sucedida não deveria retornar erros ou avisos, apenas uma "
"lista de testes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:337
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:341
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>find ... ;</command>: Fixes permissions of documentation files and "
"directories."
msgstr ""
"<command>find ... ;</command>: Corrige permissões de arquivos e diretórios "
"da documentação."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:346
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-gpl</parameter>: Enables the use of GPL code and permits"
" support for postprocessing, swscale and many other features."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-gpl</parameter>: habilita o uso de código GPL e permite "
"suporte para pós-processamento, swscale e muitos outros recursos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:351
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-version3</parameter>: Enables the use of (L)GPL version "
"3 code."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-version3</parameter>: Habilita o uso do código (L)GPL "
"versão 3."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:356
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-nonfree</parameter>: Enables the use of nonfree code.  "
"Note that the resulting libraries and binaries will be unredistributable."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-nonfree</parameter>: Habilita o uso de código não-livre."
" Observe que as bibliotecas e binários resultantes não serão "
"redistribuíveis."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:364
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-shared</parameter>: Enables building shared libraries, "
"otherwise only static libraries are built and installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-shared</parameter>: Habilita construir bibliotecas "
"compartilhadas, caso contrário, somente bibliotecas estáticas serão "
"construídas e instaladas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:369
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-debug</parameter>: Disables building debugging symbols "
"into the programs and libraries."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-debug</parameter>: Desabilita construir símbolos de "
"depuração nos aplicativos e bibliotecas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:374
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-libaom</parameter>: Enables AV1 encoding and decoding "
"via <filename class=\"libraryfile\">libaom</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-libaom</parameter>: Habilita codificar e decodificar AV1"
" via <filename class=\"libraryfile\">libaom</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:379
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-libass</parameter>: Enables ASS/SSA subtitle format "
"rendering via <filename class=\"libraryfile\">libass</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-libass</parameter>: Habilita a renderização do formato "
"de legenda ASS/SSA via <filename class=\"libraryfile\">libass</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:384
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-libdav1d</parameter>: Enables AV1 decoding via <filename"
" class=\"libraryfile\">libdav1d</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-libdav1d</parameter>: Habilita decodificar AV1 via "
"<filename class=\"libraryfile\">libdav1d</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:389
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-libdrm</option>: Use this switch if <xref "
"linkend=\"libdrm\"/> is installed to build the <quote>kmsgrab</quote> input "
"module which is useful for screen capturing or streaming."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-libdrm</option>: Use essa chave, se o <xref "
"linkend=\"libdrm\"/> estiver instalado, para construir o módulo de entrada "
"<quote>kmsgrab</quote>, o qual é útil para captura ou transmissão de tela."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:395
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-libfdk-aac</parameter>: Enables AAC audio encoding via "
"<filename class=\"libraryfile\">libfdk-aac</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-libfdk-aac</parameter>: Habilita a codificação de áudio "
"AAC via <filename class=\"libraryfile\">libfdk-aac</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:400
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-libfreetype</parameter>: Enables "
"<application>Freetype</application> support."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-libfreetype</parameter>: Habilita suporte a "
"<application>Freetype</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:405
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-libmp3lame</parameter>: Enables MP3 audio encoding via "
"<filename class=\"libraryfile\">libmp3lame</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-libmp3lame</parameter>: Habilita a codificação de áudio "
"MP3 via <filename class=\"libraryfile\">libmp3lame</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:419
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-libsvtav1</parameter>: Enables AV1 encoding via "
"<filename class=\"libraryfile\">libSvtAv1Enc</filename>. It however only "
"supports chroma subsampling of YUV420."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-libsvtav1</parameter>: Habilita codificar AV1 via "
"<filename class=\"libraryfile\">libSvtAv1Enc</filename>. Entretanto, somente"
" suporta subamostragem de croma de YUV420."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:425
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-libvorbis</parameter> <parameter>--enable-"
"libvpx</parameter>: Enables WebM encoding via <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libvorbis</filename> and <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libvpx</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-libvorbis</parameter> <parameter>--enable-"
"libvpx</parameter>: Habilita codificação WebM via <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libvorbis</filename> e <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libvpx</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:432
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-libx264</parameter>: Enables high-quality H.264/MPEG-4 "
"AVC encoding via <filename class=\"libraryfile\">libx264</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-libx264</parameter>: Habilita a codificação H.264/MPEG-4"
" AVC de alta qualidade via <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libx264</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:438
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-libx265</parameter>: Enables high-quality H.265/HEVC "
"encoding via <filename class=\"libraryfile\">libx265</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-libx265</parameter>: Habilita a codificação H.265/HEVC "
"de alta qualidade via <filename class=\"libraryfile\">libx265</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:444
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-openssl</parameter>: Enables HTTPS protocol for network "
"streams."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-openssl</parameter>: Habilita o protocolo HTTPS para "
"fluxos de rede de intercomunicação."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:457
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--ignore-tests=...</parameter>: Disables tests that fail to run "
"on BLFS without the optional packages. Currently the AV1 test is disabled as"
" it needs dav1d to do AV1 decoding on the CPU. The test might work if you "
"have a GPU that can decode AV1, but this was not tested."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--ignore-tests=...</parameter>: Desabilita testes que falham para"
" executar no BLFS sem os pacotes opcionais. Atualmente o teste AV1 está "
"desabilitado porque precisa do dav1d para fazer decodificação AV1 na CPU. O "
"teste pode funcionar se você tiver uma GPU que consiga decodificar AV1, mas "
"isso não foi testado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:465
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-gnutls</option>: Use this option instead of "
"<parameter>--enable-openssl</parameter>, if you want to use "
"<application>GnuTLS</application> instead of "
"<application>OpenSSL</application> for HTTPS protocol."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-gnutls</option>: Use essa opção, em vez de "
"<parameter>--enable-openssl</parameter>, se você quiser usar "
"<application>GnuTLS</application> em vez de "
"<application>OpenSSL</application> para protocolo HTTPS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:472
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-doc</option>: Disables building html documentation.  This "
"is only needed if <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> is installed and you do not "
"want to build the html documentation."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-doc</option>: Desabilita construir documentação HTML. Isso"
" somente é necessário se o <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> estiver instalado e "
"você não quiser construir a documentação HTML."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:478
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-libpulse</option>: Enables support for "
"<application>Pulseaudio</application> for audio output."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-libpulse</option>: Habilita suporte para "
"<application>Pulseaudio</application> para saída de áudio."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:483
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-libplacebo</option>: Enables support for "
"<application>libpulse</application> for hardware accelerated color spaces."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-libplacebo</option>: Habilita suporte para "
"<application>libpulse</application> para espaços de cores acelerados por "
"hardware."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:489
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>gcc tools/qt-faststart.c -o tools/qt-faststart</command>: This "
"builds the <command>qt-faststart</command> program which can modify "
"QuickTime formatted movies (<filename class=\"extension\">.mov</filename> or"
" <filename class=\"extension\">.mp4</filename>) so that the header "
"information is located at the beginning of the file instead of the end.  "
"This allows the movie file to begin playing before the entire file has been "
"downloaded."
msgstr ""
"<command>gcc tools/qt-faststart.c -o tools/qt-faststart</command>: Isso "
"constrói o aplicativo <command>qt-faststart</command>, o qual pode modificar"
" filmes formatados em QuickTime (<filename "
"class=\"extension\">.mov</filename> ou <filename "
"class=\"extension\">.mp4</filename>), de forma que as informações do "
"cabeçalho estejam localizadas no início do arquivo, e não no final. Isso "
"permite que o arquivo do filme comece a ser reproduzido antes que todo o "
"arquivo tenha sido baixado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:500
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Support for most of the dependency packages requires using options passed to"
" the <command>configure</command> script. View the output from "
"<command>./configure --help</command> for complete information about "
"enabling dependency packages."
msgstr ""
"O suporte para a maioria dos pacotes de dependências exige usar opções "
"passadas para o conjunto de comandos sequenciais "
"<command>configure</command>. Veja-se a saída gerada a partir de "
"<command>./configure --help</command> para informações completas relativas a"
" habilitar pacotes de dependências."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:510
#, xml-text
msgid "Contents"
msgstr "Conteúdo"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><segmentedlist><segtitle>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:513
#, xml-text
msgid "Installed Programs"
msgstr "Aplicativos Instalados"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><segmentedlist><segtitle>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:514
#, xml-text
msgid "Installed Libraries"
msgstr "Bibliotecas Instaladas"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><segmentedlist><segtitle>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/videoutils/ffmpeg.xml:515
#, xml-text
msgid "Installed Directories"
msgstr "Diretórios Instalados"

